      description: 'Counts ''BUG: unable to handle / Oops: / segfault at'' lines in
        the PREVIOUS boot''s kernel log (persists until the next reboot). Any value
        >0 is the Oct-2026 zombie-incident class -- pull `journalctl -b -1 -k` on
        the box, check /var/lib/systemd/pstore and /var/crash.'
