      description: "blackbox iframe-self probe to {{ '{{' }} $labels.instance }} has failed\
        \ for 5 minutes \u2014 the vhost is returning X-Frame-Options: DENY or CSP\
        \ frame-ancestors 'none', which silently breaks admin UIs whose console pane\
        \ is a same-origin iframe (Proxmox Console tab, Tanium server console). Loosen\
        \ to SAMEORIGIN / 'self' for the affected vhost in roles/loadbalancer_service/templates/nginx.conf.j2."
    labels:
